5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since we need to decide on a destination before bookings open, we should prioritize cost and logistics. I'll start by looking into the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is key, but comfort is often overlooked. I'll check the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the attendance sheets for the away camps to see how previous trips actually fared.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to make sure everyone can enjoy the camp without anyone working too hard. I'll look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree that costs are a priority. I will look into the group transport in three years of receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets to get a clearer picture of the actual expenses.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm more worried about how we actually spend our time there. I'll check what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the membership list against first-train times to see who can actually make it.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we have a good spread of information. @Misaki, since we are both looking into whole-building lets, let's compare our findings later to see if there are hidden costs.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Comparing notes is fine, but let's not get bogged down in just the numbers. Logistics are useless if the environment is subpar. I'm more interested in the actual quality of the experience.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I agree with @Shion. I hope we can find a place where everyone feels relaxed. I'm curious if the cooking duties were very difficult last year, so I'll check that carefully.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, that sounds like a plan. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of the total costs this time to avoid any surprises.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, quality isn't just about the building. If we keep splitting up by year-group, the experience is garbage regardless of the location. We need a place that actually forces us to interact.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, while social interaction is important, it shouldn't override the budget. If we choose a place that's too expensive or difficult to reach, we risk people dropping out, which complicates the finances further.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, your caution is predictable, but overly rigid budgeting often leads to mediocre results. If we prioritize the cheapest option, we risk repeating past failures. Quality is a logical investment in the camp's overall success.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I think both of you have good points. Maybe there's a way to find a place that is affordable but still lets everyone have a great time together without being too stressful for the organizers?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, that is the ideal goal. However, we can only find that balance if we are honest about the actual spending. I want to make sure our budget is based on reality, not just estimates.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, reality is more than just receipts. If the atmosphere is dead, the budget doesn't matter. We need a destination that breaks these cliques, or we're just wasting money on another boring trip.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Let's focus on the data first. Once we have the rates and transport costs, we can evaluate which destinations allow for both the interaction @Takumi wants and the budget @Misaki and I are prioritizing. I'm ready to proceed.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Data is merely a tool, not the answer itself. I'll be watching to see if your ""precise"" numbers actually account for the human element. Let's see what the records reveal. I'm ready.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm looking forward to seeing what we find. I hope the information helps us choose a place where everyone can be happy and no one has to struggle too much. I'm ready too!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's gather the facts first. I'll be focusing on the actual expenditure from previous years to ensure our planning is grounded in reality. I am ready.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine. Get your numbers and your ""quality"" reports. I'll be looking for the real problems. If we don't fix the way we're split up, this camp is a waste of time. I'm ready.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
